abstract: >-
  An interactive cinematic visual proof of almost everything that is known
  about the Collatz conjecture — Terras density, the reverse tree, the
  parity-vector engine — and the lemma that remains. Author: Benjamin
  Stanley Frohman. Private priority deposit 18 September 2026. All rights
  reserved until a signed public release.
